"description":"Personalized Healthcare focused on integrated access to benefits and clinical guidance right from your phone. Your Accolade Health Assistant® now adds our best-in-class virtual urgent and primary care physicians. You also gain access to our own therapists and medical specialists right at your fingertips. Our goal is to provide you with the best whole-person care in a way that meets your goals and your schedule.\n\n* Message your health assistant securely, with an easy way to connect by phone if needed\n\n* Get answers to coverage and benefits\n\n* Speak to a physician virtually 24 hours a day\n\n* Connect with mental health providers\n\n* Get a second opinion with access to our nation-wide specialists\n\n* Ask your health assistant for help finding a nearby local physician or facility\n\n* Get answers to your questions regarding your healthcare bills\n\n* Use the Accolade virtual wallet - share cards with your doctor right from the app\n\n* Also use your prescription benefit card from the app\n\nDon’t have an Accolade Health Assistant® yet? When you send your first secure message from the app, you’ll be assigned a dedicated health assistant for your entire family. Your health assistant gets to know you and understand your needs and goals. They will help you make the best decisions for you and your family.", "bundleId":"com.accolade.apps.exclusive", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.83086999999999999744204615126363933086395263671875, "sellerUrl":"http://www.accolade.com/", "averageUserRating":4.83086999999999999744204615126363933086395263671875, "trackCensoredName":"Accolade, Inc.", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes":"253711360", "formattedPrice":"Free", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":43347, "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/accolade-inc/id1203452254?uo=4", "trackContentRating":"12+", "userRatingCount":43347}, 
